{% extends "template.njk" %}

{% set pageTitle = "Producer Onboarding - HMCTS API Marketplace - GOV.UK" %}
{% set section = "documentation" %}
{% set breadcrumbs = [
  { text: "Home", href: "/" },
  { text: "Documentation", href: "/documentation" }
] %}

{% block content %}

<div class="govuk-grid-row">
  <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">

    <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Producer Onboarding</h1>

    <p class="govuk-body-l">
      Publish your API on the HMCTS API Marketplace so that other teams and partners can find it, try
      it safely, and request access. This page explains what you need before you start, and what
      happens next.
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m" id="before-you-start">Before you start</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      You need all six of these before onboarding can start. If anything is missing, fix it first.
    </p>

    <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
      <li>A clear description of your API, written as an OpenAPI specification, with sample responses
        &mdash; including what errors look like. Samples must not contain real data.</li>
      <li>Security checks in your API. It checks the security token on every call.</li>
      <li>System-to-system sign-in (OAuth 2.0). The applications that call your API sign in, not
        people.</li>
      <li>Your API running in each environment we connect to: a test environment with no live data,
        and a live environment.</li>
      <li>Approval to share it with people outside your team.</li>
      <li>A private connection. The marketplace can reach your API privately, agreed with our platform
        team.</li>
    </ol>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      Read the <a class="govuk-link" href="/documentation/producer-standards">Producer Guidance</a> page for
      the technical requirements in more detail.
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m" id="how-it-fits-together">How it fits together</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      Your API stays with your team. The marketplace puts the catalogue, the security checks and
      Try it now in front of it. For a consumer, it works like this:
    </p>

    <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
      <li>They find your API in the catalogue and sign up.</li>
      <li>They build and test their integration using Try it now: a practice copy of your API that
        returns your sample responses.</li>
      <li>Once approved, their calls reach your real API.</li>
    </ol>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      Every call goes through our secure gateway, which checks who is calling before anything
      reaches you.
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m" id="how-onboarding-works">How onboarding works</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      Unless a step says otherwise, you and the API Marketplace team do it together.
    </p>

    <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
      <li><strong>Check you are ready.</strong> Go through the list above. You do this.</li>
      <li><strong>Agree the basics.</strong> <a class="govuk-link" href="mailto:APIMarketplace@hmcts.net">Email us</a>.
        We agree a short name for your API, which environments we connect to, and how we connect.</li>
      <li><strong>Set up secure access.</strong> We create your API's security identity. Your team sets
        your API to accept tokens from it.</li>
      <li><strong>Connect.</strong> We register your API on our gateway and open the private
        connection to it.</li>
      <li><strong>Build Try it now.</strong> We build Try it now from the sample responses you
        supplied in step 1. We do this.</li>
      <li><strong>List it and test it.</strong> Your API appears in the catalogue, and we test the
        whole journey together.</li>
      <li><strong>Go live.</strong> We release it on the live gateway, then your team publishes the
        API version.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m" id="what-you-get">What you get</h2>

    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>A listing in the API Marketplace catalogue, with your documentation.</li>
      <li>Self-service sign-up, so consumers can register without emailing you.</li>
      <li>Try it now, so consumers can build and test against sample data before getting real access.</li>
      <li>A secure gateway that checks identity and limits traffic before calls reach you.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m" id="get-in-touch">Get in touch</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      To start onboarding, or if you have a question, email the API Marketplace team at
      <a class="govuk-link" href="mailto:APIMarketplace@hmcts.net">APIMarketplace@hmcts.net</a>.
    </p>

  </div>
</div>

{% endblock %}
